    - target: {fileID: 8925962398805234337, guid: 72630b16283a27548bfdb9ee1e8cad29, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Locked, perhaps a key will allow access to the corpse
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8925962398805234337, guid: 72630b16283a27548bfdb9ee1e8cad29, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: '"So the king has entrusted you with saving the world!"'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8925962398805234337, guid: 72630b16283a27548bfdb9ee1e8cad29, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: '"I wish I were in your position! But I can barely hold my own against
        a gnome... "'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8925962398805234337, guid: 72630b16283a27548bfdb9ee1e8cad29, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: '"We were sent with you to provide you with equipment! "'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8925962398805234337, guid: 72630b16283a27548bfdb9ee1e8cad29, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: '"Obviously, at a cost... But you''ll see that as you progress!"'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8925962398805234337, guid: 72630b16283a27548bfdb9ee1e8cad29, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: '"The kingdom''s witch is waiting for you at the back to give you your
        new equipment. "'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8925962398805234337, guid: 72630b16283a27548bfdb9ee1e8cad29, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[6]'
      value: '"The king thought your tools were a bit crude. Go to the back with
        her!"'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
